    "body": "It was he\u2019s arms that I loved The way they reached for me in the night with a passive craving for the fire in my bones.\n\n[private line held back in this public build]\n\n[private line held back in this public build]\n\n[private line held back in this public build]\n\nIt was he\u2019s boyish rebellion which I hated. That destructive inducing which pulled me off my lanterned path.\n\n[private line held back in this public build]\n\nIt was he\u2019s flawed character which I hated. Those blind ways of arrogance that crippled my functioning for days.\n\nIt was the paradox which caught me. The tender mercy to my girl-like manner. Given to me after he hunted my swan and plucked my feathers.\n\nIt was the twisted comfort of a nest, which in fact had me as the captive in a lair.\n\nThe illusion of safety. The promise of home. The chemical downfall of he\u2019s hiding. The brittle sticks of a foundation. [private line held back in this public build] The broken boy crying behind the mask of a hooligan. The comfort over change. The pause over action. The perfection for a few days which unfolded into a vicious plot of torment. The beauty tarnished by cheap mannerisms of polluted laughter with friends every time I left. [private line held back in this public build] My castle walls instantly demolished by he\u2019s lack of intimate boundaries.\n\nMe\u2026 the shadow ! The kept secret ! The cheaply entertained guest to fill a void. The mysterious visitor in a flammable world. Me\u2026 the barren woman listening to laughter of offspring. Robbed of my womanhood to settle for empty words. The insulted absence of effort Covered up by sweetly decorated ideas. The aggressive war laid at the feet of my pastel gardens. [private line held back in this public build] Denied my throne and seat at the banquet. The jewel-less crown [private line held back in this public build] The smoke-filled chamber\u2026 Being offered as my home.\n\nMe\u2026 the enigma of my world The enchantress of my sanity [private line held back in this public build] Me\u2026 the whimsical realm, Taken Claimed All as my own !",
