    "body": "[private line held back in this public build] Those are your own to face. [private line held back in this public build] Your demonic strategies you used to try blind me have no more place in my beautiful and bountiful life You have been a rapist of my soul and I have burnt your evil at the stake. I lit the match and watched it burn.  Your entire village of promises, consumed by luscious licks of flames reaching for the moon. Reciting and chanting my name. My dreams that you weaved into a manipulative cage. My womb you drained [private line held back in this public build] Remember your last words to me. Your last scribes. [private line held back in this public build] No beauty No kindness No understanding No deep exploring of the cosmic forces that lie within me. You intentional tried to humiliate me Purposefully tried to sway me. Tactically tried to bind and blind fold me to keep me in your isolating cage.\n\n[private line held back in this public build] Your deceit Your devil you feed and dance with. [private line held back in this public build] This is only the beginning for you. The wolves are still coming. There is no redemption for you with me None of my time Not my face [private line held back in this public build]\n\nI was your guide. Your lantern and protector. Your teacher. [private line held back in this public build] Now my final purpose will be to show you the universal truths of choice and consequence. I tried to save you. You chose your devil and darkness. For this you must now lie in the grave you have dug which could of been a meadow of colour and sweet scents. Instead - you bury bodies.\n\nI am no more No daisy chains around my neck. No more laughs or love or light to give you. You made your selfish choices You chose yourself when I chose the devil and the weak boy in you.\n\nThere is no more. You have been purged from my soul. Go walk your walk Muzzle your mouth that spits out lies and watch.\n\nWatch closely.\n\nAllow my black cloudy face to disperse into a million birds set free. Allow my existence to be nothing but a memory. Don\u2019t say my name or have hope for a pleasant parting. It is done. Final. Dead. Mourn and surrender into your own weakness. I am no longer your savior. I am the queen of my own castle The creator of my own Kingdom. [private line held back in this public build] My door is closed and you no longer have the key. My hunters and wolves guarded these doors. You are not welcome here. Surrender before you start a war you will not win.\n\nThis is the truth and your saving grace.\n\nLearn to listen.\n\nContinue and you will not make it out of my woods whole. The violation of my sanctity will no longer be spoilt and splattered by your attempts. Let go. Change direction. My light does not burn to melt your cold and crippled heart. It is my crown. One I wear for myself alone. I am not a woman alone. I am wolf Woman And Moon. While you steal dreams in the night, I take back strength and climb. I\u2019m perched high while you choose to squabble at the feet of my throne.\n\n[private line held back in this public build]\n\nThe woman I gave you is now a black swarm because it is gone.\n\nLet go of the corpse you carry. Leave in peace. [private line held back in this public build] You will learn to understand But this will take a lifetime for you.\n\nOne day you\u2019ll wake up and see that your lashers whipped on a warrior only made it stronger. Your demonic ways only fuel my fire And as I grow and climb and conquer the soft body of the sky and earth, the only memory I\u2019ll carry is how your brutality made me feel. I allowed myself to be crucified for you. [private line held back in this public build] Your ignorance and arrogance made the choice for you. Willfully.\n\nHow shameful.\n\nI have no bitterness Just more wisdom and discernment.\n\nI have no rage. Just a fueled up spirit with dreams so much greater that you would never be able to meet  or steal. How beautiful for me. How magnanimous for my unconquered nature. The seasons come and go but you never fed your roots and have now diminished by my winters breath.\n\nYou can choose to plant new seeds and start again.\n\nFind your own land. Burn bodies or plant new trees.\n\nI am not from earth and you no longer have a home with me.\n\n[private line held back in this public build]\n\nMake peace with these truths or they will be the noose you stumble into.\n\nI am free. Whole again and complete. You can not contain a spirit with fleshly hands.\n\nI leave you behind in peace. Let me be. You have tortured enough. If you continue to come for me, I will skin you with one flick of my eyes and wear your fur while I walk for all to see that I am the victor.\n\nBe free",
